COMPARATORS

PASSIVE PROMOTION
Promote:
every passive nominee.

VALIDATE EVERY NOMINEE
Challenge:
all passive nominees.

Promote only if:
challenge agrees in:
sign
and:
magnitude.

VALUE-GATED CHALLENGE
Estimate:

future semantic loss avoided
by:
learning this interaction.

Challenge only if:

estimated future value
>
challenge cost
+
permanent state cost.

Then:
promote only after:
independent semantic confirmation.

